1c:T730,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"SkyLinX机场跑路了吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"截至2026年9月28日没有跑路：官网能注册、下单，九个套餐都在售，后台9月还在更新公告。但它2026年才开始运营，官方交流群只有几百人，网上几乎没有用户评价，第一次买建议先用优惠码shiyong666领2GB试用，再买月付。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"SkyLinX官网是哪个？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官方公告列出的官网是 portal.skylinx.org 和 user.skylinx.org，另外 www.skylinx.org 也是同一个用户中心，三个账号互通。不带前缀的 skylinx.org 打不开，不是入口。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"SkyLinX有优惠码吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"有一个试用码 shiyong666：在商店选「试用套餐」，结账时填这个码，价格变成0元，可以领2GB流量先测线路。正式套餐没有公开的打折码，长付也不打折。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"SkyLinX能解锁奈飞吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官方没有宣传奈飞解锁，只写了新加坡、美国、日本、台湾、香港节点可以用ChatGPT、Gemini等AI。本站也没有实测。想看Netflix的话，先领2GB试用，把订阅贴到测速网站逐个节点查解锁情况，再决定买不买。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"SkyLinX用什么客户端？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官方要求必须用使用文档里列出的客户端，否则可能用不了：Windows用Clash Verge或FClash，安卓用Clash Meta、FClash或NekoBox，苹果手机用小火箭或Karing，Mac用Clash Verge、ClashX或Mihomo Party。公告说小火箭目前有问题，建议优先用Karing。"}}]}12:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-foreground/85 marker:text-accent","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-7","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"没跑路，但很新"}]}],["$","$1","1",